# Brand Identity Generator - Environment Variables
#
# SECURITY NOTE:
# This application uses Google Gemini for AI generation.
# For production deployments, NEVER commit a real API key.
#
# Recommended approaches (in order of security):
#   1. Users provide their own key via the in-app "Set API Key" button (BYOK mode)
#   2. Deploy with a secure backend proxy (Vercel Edge Functions / Cloudflare Workers)
#      that holds the key server-side
#
# Local development only:
# Copy this file to .env.local (or .env) and add your key below.

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Optional: If you later implement a secure proxy, set the base URL here
# VITE_API_PROXY_URL=https://your-proxy.example.com/api
